Z||000000||CUTTER||04-24-2000||03:17 AM||||I was at the auto store and seen a super coil for the v6 fiero for $55, I am looking for performance in my car but know NOTHING about the super coil, or any coil as in how they install, what they do, there performance. Or anything. Any info on the super coild will be greatly appreciated.<BR>    Thanks, Shane||||reg||1
Z||000001||Gokart||04-24-2000||06:41 AM||||Got mine from the Fiero Store Friday. Installed it Saturday and will be leaving for work in 1/2 hour. Figure at least it will out live the oem one. Will let you know if I notice any difference tonight! I know Cobra's got one too but his is a different model than mine.||||reg||1
Z||000002||sdm1964||04-24-2000||10:10 AM||||The super coils are suppose to provide a hotter spark, hence: cleaner plugs, better fuel burn, smooother idle, better performance. I was thinking of adding a super coil and MSD to my 86 SE once i get it fixed.||||reg||10
Z||000003||Gokart||04-24-2000||08:06 PM||||After looking at the Fiero Store catalog I noticed my coil is called a "performance" coil. I don't think it's the same as the "super" coil but I'm very happy with it. Starts right up and seemed to improve acceleration a little. Does the super coil fit in the stock position the way my performance coil does?||||reg||1
Z||000004||88formula||04-24-2000||08:18 PM||||I have the Accel Super coil. This coil is supposed to give a stronger hotter spark where the factory coil starts to fade in efficiency at high RPM. When I put this coil in and drove my Formula I noticed no increase in acceleration or power. I don't think you will unless you have a weak of failing ignition coil. The factory coil does a pretty good job of providing spark for the RPM range that the stock cam has. If I were going to get another hi-output coil I would get the MSD coil because it is cheaper. Part # is MSD #8226 coil in the JEGS catalog, I think it is about $35. At the most I would guess that a hi-output ignition would give you 2 max hourse power at the engines peak power output and that is being optimistic.||||reg||1
